Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: Pods not starting or sidecar not injected

# Solution: Check namespace labeling
oc get namespace bookstore-app --show-labels
oc label namespace bookstore-app istio-injection=enabled --overwrite
Issue: Services not communicating

# Solution: Check service discovery
oc get endpoints -n bookstore-app
istioctl proxy-config endpoints <pod-name>.bookstore-app
Issue: mTLS connection failures

# Solution: Verify peer authentication
istioctl authn tls-check <service-name>.bookstore-app.svc.cluster.local
Issue: Authorization policies blocking traffic

# Solution: Check authorization policies
oc get authorizationpolicy -n bookstore-app
istioctl proxy-config rbac <pod-name>.bookstore-app
Issue: High latency or timeouts

# Solution: Check destination rules and virtual services
istioctl proxy-config route <pod-name>.bookstore-app
oc describe virtualservice -n bookstore-app
